{"availability":"available","full":"ponponon/openctrlc","name":"openctrlc","description":"An open-source AI coding agent and independent OpenCode fork for terminal, web, and desktop development workflows.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-19T03:26:45Z","updated":"2026-10-07T17:14:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"dev","homepage":"https://openctrlc.pages.dev","topics":["ai","coding-agent","developer-tools","electron","opencode","terminal"],"demo":"https://openctrlc.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.280Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.280Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.280Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.280Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open-source AI coding agent built on OpenCode, with a richer desktop and remote workflow.","OpenCtrlC is an independently maintained open-source fork of OpenCode. We started this project to build on OpenCode's AI coding foundation and make it more comfortable for everyday work across a visual desktop app and remote access.","OpenCode gives us a strong foundation for AI-assisted coding. OpenCtrlC extends that foundation with a product focus on desktop usability, clear session history, and working from more than one device:"],"features":["A richer desktop workflow — use a native app on macOS, Windows, or Linux, alongside the CLI and TUI. The desktop shares the local project and session model with the CLI, with session search, turn navigation, context…","Phone access to your workspace — pair with a QR code, approve the browser in the desktop app, and open the current workspace from your phone. The desktop connects outbound through a relay, so you do not need to expose a…","The coding workflow stays inspectable — review tool calls, generated changes, and command results; choose the model provider or local model that fits your work; and keep project rules and Skills close to the code.","Bring compatible OpenCode sessions along — export readable transcripts and import compatible sessions by ID."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ponponon/openctrlc/blob/dev/README.md","fingerprint":"498b761f47c2e2bfef5d80f99190c92fff647f7299473710b98136cdbccca6d2","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.411Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.411Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open-source AI coding agent built on OpenCode, with a richer desktop and remote workflow.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ponponon/openctrlc/blob/dev/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"498b761f47c2e2bfef5d80f99190c92fff647f7299473710b98136cdbccca6d2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ponponon/openctrlc/blob/dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.411Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T17:14:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ponponon/openctrlc/blob/dev/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T18:42:55.412Z","hash":"498b761f47c2e2bfef5d80f99190c92fff647f7299473710b98136cdbccca6d2","originalBytes":5590,"storedBytes":5590,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["openctrlc","desktop","bun","install","opencode","project","run","app","bash","cli","github","model","npm","build","foundation","installer","provider","release","session","coding","console","cwd","dev","discussions","docs","download","license","linux","local","macos","openctrlc.pages.dev","packages","relay","remote","tap","through","workflow","workspace","application","arm64","assets","before","bin","changes","choose","compatible","configuration","contributing.md","current","dir","homebrew","latest","maintained","only","open-source","package","product","read","release.md","releases","richer","service.","sessions","share","sharing","visual","when","windows","work","x64","access","access.","across","adds","affiliated","agent","ai-assisted","along","alongside","analysis","appimage","apple","apply","appr